{% comment %}
  Vault rails — homepage product carousels with first-scroll dedupe.
  One section owns all four rails so `seen_ids` can span popular → rare → low → beauty-sets.
  First `visible_limit` cards per rail skip any product id already shown in an earlier rail.
  Dru 2026-10-05: do NOT feature sold-out on homepage rails — skip unavailable products.
  Sold-out stay on site and collection pages. Prefer featured_media; fill without-media only if still short.
  Beauty Sets rail: skip audited misfiled singles (denylist) unless product.type contains Beauty Set.
  Dru/Eve 2026-10-05: Discover full wrapping grid after Beauty Sets (randomized in-stock, not a rail).
  YSL Signature Strobing Sculpt (KEEP_SET) removed from sb_bs_block denylist.
{% endcomment %}

{% assign seen_ids = ',' %}
{% assign visible_limit = section.settings.visible_limit | default: 5 %}
{% assign products_per_rail = section.settings.products_per_rail | default: 12 %}

{% for block in section.blocks %}
  {% if block.type != 'rail' %}{% continue %}{% endif %}

  {% assign handle = block.settings.collection_handle | strip %}
  {% if handle == blank and block.settings.collection != blank %}
    {% assign handle = block.settings.collection.handle %}
  {% endif %}
  {% assign col = collections[handle] %}
  {% if block.settings.collection != blank %}
    {% assign col = block.settings.collection %}
  {% endif %}

  {% assign heading = block.settings.heading %}
  {% if heading == blank and col != blank %}
    {% assign heading = col.title %}
  {% endif %}
  {% if heading == blank %}
    {% assign heading = handle | replace: '-', ' ' | capitalize %}
  {% endif %}
  {% assign subheading = block.settings.subheading %}

  {% assign href = '/collections/' | append: handle %}
  {% if col != blank %}
    {% assign href = col.url %}
  {% endif %}

  <section class="section vault-rail" id="vault-rail-{{ block.id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    <div class="page-width">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          {% if subheading != blank %}
            <p class="kicker">{{ subheading }}</p>
          {% endif %}
          <h2>{{ heading }}</h2>
        </div>
        {% if handle != blank %}
          <a class="kicker" href="{{ href }}">View all</a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

